 ##
 # ButtonMaxMoveMm = 1.5
 
+##
+## Lift grace period (in milliseconds). A contact that vanishes for less than this long and
+## reappears within 5 mm of where it was is treated as continuous: no lift, no new touch down,
+## same tracking id. Bridges short dropouts of the sensor, which show up as ghost taps while
+## sliding and ghost right clicks while scrolling. Also hides them from the button gating.
+## 0 disables. (Default 30)
+##
+## Idea from ProgrammerIn-wonderland's ELLX iptsd build (LiftGraceMs).
+##
+# LiftGraceMs = 30
+
 [Contacts]
 ##
 ## How the neutral value of the heatmap will be determined.
